xen: Implement support for new kexec load types

The new load types allow kexec to work with Secure Boot.

With the new load types, purgatory is provided by Xen so leave that part out.
For verification purposes, the entire kernel is passed in as the first segment
so rework the loader accordingly.

Signed-off-by: Kevin Lampis <klampis@cloud.com>
Signed-off-by: Gerald Elder-Vass <gerald.elder-vass@cloud.com>
